      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Replay dead letters\n\n**Origin:** New demonstration example.\n\n**Run it:** Fix the cause first. Then edit Replay selection and execute. Requeued jobs are picked up by the job worker; a successful run resolves the dead letter.\n\nConnect the Postgres nodes to a credential for the `resilience` database after import.",
